     2	 * @file  ewk_cookie_parser
     3	 * @brief EWK Cookie Parser
     4	 *
     5	 * This class exposes the Chromium cookie parser. It allows
     6	 * for ewk components to handle cookie-alike structures without
     7	 * re-inventing the wheel.
     8	 *
